     "object": "obj_mevarech_lifnei_kohen",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "למימרא דמעליותא היא? והא אמר ר' יוחנן: a scholar before whom even an ignorant high priest leads the blessing is liable to death! (kind svara under protest: an amoraic-memra contradiction)",
     "against": "p_perida_kohen",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ry_mevarech_lefanav",
     "gloss_en": "R' Yochanan: any Torah scholar before whom [another] leads the blessing, even an ignorant high priest -- that scholar is liable to death"
    }
   ]
  },
  "4": {
   "segId": "Megillah.28a.5",
