     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "והא גרמא ליה? והאמר ר' יצחק: Avimelech's curse of Sarah was fulfilled in her seed (Gen 20:16) -- that caused Isaac's blindness! (kind svara under protest: an amoraic-memra contradiction)",
     "against": "p_elazar_yitzchak_esav",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ry_kilelat_hedyot",
     "gloss_en": "R' Yitzchak: let an ordinary man's curse never be light in your eyes"
    }
   ]
  },
  "17": {
   "segId": "Megillah.28a.18",
   "sugya": "megillah_27b_bama_heerachta_yamim",
